    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Senior, Creative Director level, 10+ yrs. Independent Creative Director, designer and lettering artist based in New York (originally Poland). Per her own current site she is now independent, formerly Creative Director at COLLINS; also worked with/at Pentagram, Apple and Something Special Studios. Work Status Freelance: her self-maintained site says independent (LinkedIn still lists COLLINS Senior Designer, treated as stale). She moves between two worlds: complex brand identity systems for global brands and boundary-pushing lettering/typography (influences cited as graffiti and street type). Selected clients: The New York Times, New York Magazine, United Nations, Apple, Google, Nike, Rapha (incl. a collection for 10 years of women cycling), Bose, GQ, Bon Appetit, Dolby. Recognised by Young Guns and the Type Directors Club. Autonomy 5: runs her own independent practice at CD level. Links: site rogatty.com, IG @zrogatty, email zuzanna@rogatty.com, LinkedIn /in/zrogatty. Her site foregrounds two projects (The Neighbor lettering, Bose branding), shown here; deeper archive lives on the site and IG.",
